*[<tvar name="2">https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E4%B8%87%E7%BB%B4%E7%94%9F/3605422</tvar> Wan Weisheng] (1932-2015), entering public domain in 2066
*{{Q|Q9116141}} (1934-2021), entering public domain in 2072
*{{Q|Q5646645}} (1936-), still alive
*{{Q|Q9109368}} (1949-), still alive
